/target
/.claude/worktrees
# per-run history: CI artifacts carry it; only the current table + latest.json are tracked
/crates/perfsuite/results/20*.json
/.claude/agent-memory
/.claude/settings.local.json
/result
# live drawer: the daemon writes this when meridian-rs is a bound workspace
/.meridian/
# the registry's currency sentinel (crates/registry/src/feed.rs), written into
# ANY drawer a daemon binds — including the parity corpora's own `.meridian/`,
# which the root-anchored rule above does not reach. Named rather than ignoring
# the nested drawer: those drawers carry TRACKED fixtures (`stable-read.probe`)
# and the parity pack is a byte-exact copy of ccc-statusd's testdata that must
# not be edited around. A local test run put 11 of these into a commit once.
.meridian/cookie
# seat scratch: lives beside the worktree, never in the tree
.scratch/
/.scratch-*.yaml
